#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
hpc-run: Multi-cluster persistent SSH execution tool for NOAA & HPC clusters.
Supports: Gaea (C5, C6, C7 direct head nodes), Hera, Ursa, Orion, Hercules.
Provides interactive PIN + YubiKey authentication on first launch,
then maintains a persistent background session for 0.1s instant command execution.

Features:
- Direct, independent connections to Gaea C5, C6, and C7 (no hopping through C5).
- Concurrent multi-threaded socket server (control plane never blocks).
- 120s inactivity / idle timeout with automatic SIGINT (Ctrl+C) recovery.
- Instant non-blocking health and status checks (__PING__, __STATUS__).
- Client-side SIGINT forwarding (__CANCEL__) to immediately abort remote execution.
- Asynchronous execution support (--async) for long-running batch jobs.
- Automatic headless session initialization when SSH ControlMaster is active.
"""

